WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Your pipeline. One connected workspace.
A guided look at IG Pipeline

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
See every deal. Focus on what matters.
Search, filter, and separate loan commitments from draw requests.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Start a deal in a few focused steps.
Create IG loans, Core+ deals, or draw requests. Assign the team and key dates.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Give each deal a shared home.
Keep ownership, approvals, reports, and roadblocks in view.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Know exactly what still needs review.
Filter entity documents, individual documentation, and loan conditions.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Turn open items into a clear follow-up.
Prepare a borrower email draft for your team to review.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.000
See the next closing before it arrives.
Plan scheduled closings and draw funding on one calendar.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Follow the loan beyond the next draw.
Explore funded history, pending requests, properties, and source links.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Ask Pipeline. Get an answer with evidence.
Use the current deal as context, then open the supporting records.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Designed for speed. Disciplined on cost.
Reuse fresh data, calculate exact facts, and call the model only when needed.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:24.000
A connected interface over the tools you use.
Google Apps Script coordinates the dashboard, source data, and focused services.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:28.000
From first record to the next decision.
Create. Coordinate. Review. Ask Pipeline.
